<!-- The words on screen that the Spanish Quick Start for the Android phone uses, exactly as the app
     prints them on a phone set to Español (España), read from Android app version 0.2.0.1025 on
     18 November 2026 (DEC-257). The keys are the English ones, so the pages keep the same key references.
     "Titulo" is written without its accent because the app prints it that way. -->
